# A ጽሁፍ walks its code points, the same breadth ርዝመት and x[i] already have
# (§4.3, §7.4). Indexing a string but not being able to walk it would be
# arbitrary.
# expect: ሰ
# expect: ላ
# expect: ም
# expect: 3
# expect: ጽሁፍ
ቆጥር = 0
"ሰላም" ለእያንዳንዱ ፊደሉ፦
    ጻፍ(ፊደሉ)
    ቆጥር = ቆጥር + 1
ጻፍ(ቆጥር)
ጻፍ(አይነት(ፊደሉ))
